            <div class="when">+14s 撞球</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1247052}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光绽精华 → 光绽之力</div><div class="s">吃球叠 +10% 伤害/治疗（每秒 10.4 万神圣可叠）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">按需吃球叠增伤 · 开圣盾会清层</span></div>
            <div class="why">漏球会让首领触发全队爆伤，惩戒满血带减伤帮吃 1–2 层打输出兼清场；<b>注意开圣盾术会清除身上已有的光绽之力（一并失去 +10% 伤害/治疗增益）且无敌期间不会叠加新层数</b>，想吃增伤请避开圣盾窗口。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+40s 射线</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246607}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">凝聚光线</div><div class="s">点名坦克的持续射线 · 扫中休眠鞭笞者液化成光明树脂</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">避开坦克拉线路径与光明树脂池</span></div>
            <div class="why">射线固定点名坦克，近战提前让开坦克拉线路径与液化后的高伤减速<b>光明树脂</b>；误踩进树脂池被减速时交<b>自由祝福</b>或<b>神圣马驹</b>脱身。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">全程 3s</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1247644}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>渗流木质</div><div class="s">全战每 3 秒全队神圣脉冲</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">圣佑术</span><span class="or">高压窗</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾术</span><span class="or">+</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:6940}}" alt="">牺牲祝福</span><span class="tgt">给高叠层队友</span></div>
            <div class="why">起手吃球叠加跳伤时交第一发<b>圣佑术</b>，之后每 63 秒转好配合叠层继续开；手里留好的<b>圣盾术</b>压在中后段高层掉血、躲不开树脂或救场时交出（开盾同时把牺牲丢给高叠层队友，无敌 8 秒内转伤全免，最后 4 秒注意自身血线）；保护对这里所有神圣伤害均无效。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bars">
            <div class="bar-row"><span>不开减伤</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">28.3 万 / 跳</span></div></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span>圣佑术</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:70%">19.9 万 / 跳</span></div></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span>圣盾术</span><div class="bar"><span class="zero">0 · 免疫渗流木质</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:403876}}" alt="">63 秒圣佑覆盖叠层+木质</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:642}}" alt="">圣盾留给中后段高压+8 秒无敌牺牲</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">查看天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">取自限时录像的天赋。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">这几个防御/功能天赋不要动</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:114154}}" alt=""><div><b>不败之魂</b><span>把圣盾术缩到 3.5 分钟（鲁伊亚交完进尾王前已转好）、圣佑术缩到 63 秒对齐伊库兹咆哮。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1261562}}" alt=""><div><b>复仇之盾</b><span>圣佑 8 秒额外减伤 10% 并附 10 秒吸收盾（基础 30% 最大生命值，受全能加成），稳吃喷涌之花与凶残痛击。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:305394}}" alt=""><div><b>无拘自由</b><span>二号首领伊库兹给搭档套自由祝福时同步免疫血棘之根，一张牌保两个人。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:146956}}" alt=""><div><b>圣光决断</b><span>自律期内仍能开出圣盾术并每清 1 个有害效果回 10% 血，避免鲁伊亚交完保护或圣疗被自律卡死。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">常见可换：<b>迅捷审判</b> ↔ <b>圣光的正义</b>；想把保护缩至 4 分钟时可用<b>强化保护祝福</b>换<b>圣光使者</b>（保留<b>正义保护</b>以便蛤蟆区牺牲解喷毒，若同时舍弃正义保护则蛤蟆区仅靠 8 秒清毒术单解）。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>惩戒骑 · 夺目谷 应对手册 · 2026-11</div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像：
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/Ygc1zWm3Mj4dTLBR#fight=17">欧鳇打鸡 +24 29:03</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/2JCbhkXHdf6MzDB4#fight=14">Tabris +24 29:45</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/rjp6cLXBknbtYgfa#fight=20">哦毕爷 +24 29:51</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/jH7dWrY18QF2MzqJ#fight=16">Âra +23 25:58</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/h2HMxYQmgFNZWXPG#fight=10">Khumi +23 27:38</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  var btn=document.getElementById("copy-btn"), code=document.getElementById("talent-code");
  if(btn&&code){
    btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
      var t=code.textContent.trim();
      function done(){btn.textContent="已复制";setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent="复制";},1600);}
      function fallback(){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(code);var sel=window.getSelection();sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);try{document.execCommand("copy");done();}catch(e){btn.textContent="已选中，按 Ctrl+C";}}
      if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,fallback);}else{fallback();}
    });
  }

  var links={};
  document.querySelectorAll(".nav a[href^='#']").forEach(function(a){links[a.getAttribute("href").slice(1)]=a;});
  var targets=Object.keys(links).map(function(id){return document.getElementById(id);}).filter(Boolean);
  function spy(){
    var y=window.scrollY+110, cur=targets[0]?targets[0].id:null;
    targets.forEach(function(el){if(el.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY<=y) cur=el.id;});
    if(targets.length&&window.innerHeight+window.scrollY>=document.documentElement.scrollHeight-4) cur=targets[targets.length-1].id;
    Object.keys(links).forEach(function(id){links[id].classList.toggle("on",id===cur);});
  }
  window.addEventListener("scroll",spy,{passive:true}); spy();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
